The catalog data in this repository (curation/*.yaml, curation/records/*.yaml,
data/catalog.json, data/catalog.tsv, docs/index.html, docs/records.md, the
review chapters in docs/review/ and the generated README.md) is licensed under
the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International License (CC BY 4.0).

    https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

The records and review chapters are written by hand from the cited papers.
Generated fields draw on:

  - OpenAlex bibliographic data, released under CC0
    https://openalex.org
  - Crossref, DataCite and PubMed metadata, used to verify titles and identifiers
  - GitHub repository metadata retrieved through the GitHub REST API

